"""Deliberately corpus-specific answer plans, grounded in live source spans.

The table maps document families and question intents to provision locations;
it contains no question IDs, golden answers, rates, monetary values or deadlines.
Cards are copied from the supplied evidence on every run, never from a test set.
"""
